{"id":"vod_sn_54077","vodId":"54077","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"蜡笔小新第七季","name_cn":"蜡笔小新第七季","date":"1992-01-01","year":"1992","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"HD","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20231103-1/6c1590411e8f350590a5d3497e8dba40.jpg"},"summary":"小新今年5岁了，不要以为他是那种懵懂无知的小孩，他其实人小鬼大，喜欢漂亮的姐姐，收养了一条棉花糖一样的流浪狗——小白，还经常讲些无厘头的黄色笑话。小新的妈妈美伢是一个全职主妇，粗心而又有点神经质的她经常被小新捉弄得七窍生烟，爸爸野原亦经常被这两母子搞得晕头转向。\r\n　　《蜡笔小新》的作者以一个5岁小童的眼光，40岁的成年人的心态去观察这个大千世界，看到了许多光怪陆离的景象，小新一家的幽默故事亦由此产生。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-11-03 19:48:38","playable":true,"episodeCount":156,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/QCuE4Ai06m1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/Gb2mpXX8831/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/Bt3f9h3XPr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/M73cvhPaUd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/e27FfqyVvC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/vr3P2jAGXQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/Q9Hdpfzggi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/ZxgSJXsxT71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/h9QiKt362S1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/pwbKPW2VWa1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/txKU0f0DZF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/Uuvphz1c0F1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/jkRB2FsvEy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/wTKuZi0XHX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202311/03/tzJeph2xmW1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name"